{
  "item": "Rider02",
  "mu_name": "Dinorant",
  "mu_name_from": "AccessModel(MODEL_PEGASUS, L\"Data\\\\Skill\\\\\", L\"Rider\", 2) (ZzzOpenData.cpp:4205), so Data/Skill/Rider02.bmd, its sheets from Skill\\ (OpenTexture, :4367): RDgon.OZJ and RDgonW.OZT. The ridden figure only; the bag item and the horn are Helper04.bmd. MuMain calls it MODEL_PEGASUS; the item is ITEM_HORN_OF_DINORANT, 13/3.",
  "profile": "monster",
  "profile_note": "A creature on its own rig under the rider, as Uniria's horse.",
  "rig_from": "73 bones and eight actions in ground/flying pairs: 0/1 idle, 2/3 moving (2 LockPositions), 4/5 attack, 6/7 the rider skill (GOBoid.cpp:525-595, the odd one of each pair in Tarkan, Icarus and the Kanturu Maya scene). Velocity 0.34 for every action, Uniria's (:596).",
  "play_speed": 0.34,
  "scale_from": "0.9 at CreateMount, 1.0 drawn (GOBoid.cpp:111-114, 684-691). On a ground map its Position[2] is the rider's less 30 (:517-523) while the rider is lifted 30 off the terrain (ZzzCharacter.cpp:6381-6390): the dragon stands on the ground and he sits 30 above it.",
  "sheets": {
    "rdgon": "rdgon.png",
    "rdgonw": "rdgonw.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Data/Skill/RDgon.OZJ (256x256, opaque: the blue-grey scaled hide, the leather straps and the gold horn plates) and RDgonW.OZT (128x64 with alpha: the feathered wings, 47% cut away), from MuMain's own bin/Data.",
  "tiled": true,
  "tiled_why": "The wings are alpha cards, as Uniria's mane: tiled keeps rdgonw its own sheet cut by its own alpha.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "rdgon": "fur",
    "rdgonw": "foliage"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "The hide is mostly scaled fur, so fur (straps and plates with it, a first pass). The wings are two-sided alpha cards seen from either face, lit through as the Imp's and Bat01's are: foliage.",
